From 7c5b03b6121fc8169d4fa2df0583f2de5efe9c64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Lane A <lane-a@local.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:59:27 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/22] feat(reaction): emit the REACTION_API_CONTRACT fields
 on streamer moments
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Additive only (contract §3): signals{facecam_reaction, voice_burst,
transcript_emotion, gameplay_event} as 0-1 floats or None (None means
not measured, never 0), fused_score 0-100 (the picker's own reaction x
context score with its coincidence cap), reason (one plain sentence),
and layout_recommendation in contract names (full -> gameplay_only).
Measured over each moment's window from the same per-second z-scores
the picker ranks with; gameplay_event normalised per task. Existing
fields keep their names and values. REACTION_CONTRACT_FIELDS=0 omits
them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
